          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सांभाळणे — sāmbhāḷṇe — \"to take care of; to look after\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आई कामावर गेली की आजी बाळाला सांभाळते. āī kāmāvar gelī kī ājī bāḷālā sāmbhāḷte. When Mother goes to work, Grandmother looks after the baby."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने बाळ सांभाळलं, tyāne bāḷ sāmbhāḷlaṁ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also to handle with care: सांभाळून, carefully."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
