              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "लाड करणे — lāḍ karṇe — \"to pamper\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आजोबा नातवाचे खूप लाड करतात. ājobā nātvāce khūp lāḍ kartāt. Grandfather pampers his grandson a lot."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने लाड केले, tyāne lāḍ kele."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "लाड is plural here; the one pampered takes the genitive: मुलाचे लाड करणे (lāḍ karṇe)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "लाड करणे (lāḍ karṇe) is a Marathi phrase built on लाड, \"fondling\", which CDIAL lists under the reconstructed lāḍya (CDIAL 11013), with करणे."
            }
          ]
        },
